    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Это вы что вы тут делаете, а?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you think you are doing here, huh?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Как вы решили, вегетарианцы, нормальной едой не кормить?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How did you decide not to feed vegetarians normal food?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "С мясом.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With meat.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Куда этого шефа нет?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happens when the chef is away?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А. Иди.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh. Go on.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Там сейчас вегетарианец мясо будет ездить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right now a vegetarian out there is about to eat meat.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Как мясо?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you mean, meat?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Чё ты паникуешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why are you panicking?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Даже не заметит ничего.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He will not even notice anything.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "На самом деле.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Really, it is true.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ещё спасибо скажешь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You will even thank me later.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Согласен, вегетарианские ещё идиоты.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Agreed, vegetarians are total idiots too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Идиоты, а?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
